OL,3,GNEWSAMan admits encouraging assault on
OL,4,Asleeping woman
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man from north London has pleaded
OL,7,Fguilty to charges of encouraging a man
OL,8,Fto sexually assault a woman who was
OL,9,Fasleep.
OL,11,FDarren Conway from Enfield, was charged
OL,12,Fwith nine counts of assisting or
OL,13,Fencouraging an offence, one count of
OL,14,Fvoyeurism, and one count of possessing
OL,15,Fan extreme pornographic image.
OL,17,FThe 52-year-old was part of an online
OL,18,Fforum where videos of sexual offending
OL,19,Fand domestic abuse were shared between
OL,20,Foffenders across the country.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
